# `getschema` lists the columns with 0-based ordinals; a projection-only column shows its Arrow
# type (D-042).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| getschema;
from '../../../data/types.parquet'
| project id, bin
| getschema
---- expected
ColumnName | ColumnOrdinal | DataType
string     | long          | string
-----------+---------------+---------
orderId    |             0 | string
customerId |             1 | string
amount     |             2 | real
timestamp  |             3 | datetime

ColumnName | ColumnOrdinal | DataType
string     | long          | string
-----------+---------------+---------
id         |             0 | long
bin        |             1 | Binary
